  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "年轻版的淳于总  (A Younger Version of Chun Yuqiao)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xiaoye": "小叶"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still chatting in the pantry, Chun Yuqiao asks whether Bu Xiaogu is suited to having a boyfriend, and Xiaoye cheerfully describes the ideal candidate right to his face. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她不适合找男朋友吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "她也适合呀，不过普通的男孩子不行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "就找个像淳于总您这样的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "就是事业心又强，又能跟她聊到一块去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "最好是一个年轻版的你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "年轻版？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "对，就是地位不能太高，最好是一个潜力股。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "能跟她一块成长，这样两个人才有共同话题嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么标准吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "最好还要长得帅，家境好，还要肯花时间陪女朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一下子说成自己的标准了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "淳于总，你要喝什么呀？我给你倒吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "白水喝腻了，试试咖啡吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她不适合找男朋友吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is she not suited to finding a boyfriend?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "她也适合呀，不过普通的男孩子不行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is suited to that too, except an ordinary guy will not do.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "就找个像淳于总您这样的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She should find someone just like you, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "就是事业心又强，又能跟她聊到一块去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone driven in his career who can also click with her in conversation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "最好是一个年轻版的你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ideally a younger version of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "年轻版？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A younger version?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "对，就是地位不能太高，最好是一个潜力股。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, his status cannot be too high; ideally someone with great potential.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "能跟她一块成长，这样两个人才有共同话题嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone who can grow alongside her so the two of them share common ground.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么标准吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are there any other criteria?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "最好还要长得帅，家境好，还要肯花时间陪女朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ideally he should also be handsome, from a good family, and willing to spend time with his girlfriend.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一下子说成自己的标准了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of a sudden you turned that into your own wish list.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "淳于总，你要喝什么呀？我给你倒吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, what would you like to drink? Let me pour it for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "白水喝腻了，试试咖啡吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am tired of plain water; let me try some coffee.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
